.git
.github
**/.DS_Store

# Node / build artifacts
**/node_modules
**/dist
**/build
**/.cache
**/.turbo
**/.next
**/.storybook-cache

# Mobile workspace is huge; not needed for analytics-docs build
suite-native
suite-native/**

# ...except suite-native/analytics, which analytics-docs build-data imports
!suite-native/analytics
!suite-native/analytics/**

# iOS pods can be massive if present
**/Pods
**/Pods/**

# Yarn cache can be large; not required to build when using node-modules linker
.yarn/cache
.yarn/unplugged
.yarn/install-state.gz

# Logs
**/*.log
